.TH batten-record-tool 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-record\-tool \- Record a declared tool row\*(Aqs verdict, read as `<name> <token>` lines on stdin
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten record tool\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIid\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Record a declared tool row\*(Aqs verdict, read as `<name> <token>` lines on stdin
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIid\fR>
The `[[rule.tools]]` id whose verdict is being recorded
